<title>USA: US cash DAP, ammonia flat, dealers at convention.</title>
<headline>US cash DAP, ammonia flat, dealers at convention.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. cash diammonium phosphate and ammonia prices were steady Monday in thin trading, dealers said. Many dealers were at a industry convention early this week, which kept business light.</p>
<p>			  Dlrs/short ton	 Chg from Wednesday</p>
<p>DAP central Fla	     177			unc</p>
<p>DAP central La Gulf	 188			unc</p>
<p>Ammonia/La Gulf	     220			unc</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
